  "stem": "![](asset:P000010-stem-1)A particle is undergoing SHM with origin as the mean position. Its positions were recorded at $t = 0$ and $t = \\frac{1}{6}s$ as shown in the figure. Assuming the motion to be unidirectional during the interval, the equation of the motion will be:",
